anslate(878,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D454\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D454\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1358,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,418.5) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,59)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(853,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"500\" height=\"30\" x=\"853\" y=\"829\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(521.6,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"1156.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g><rect width=\"2147.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Case III : <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.885ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 833 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>E <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.397ex\" height=\"2.737ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 6805.3 1209.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1055.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1849.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2727.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(518,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3871.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4871.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5749.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D454\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D454\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(6229.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"210E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-210E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> = Decreases</p>\n<p>Option (C) is correct because friction is depend on surface.</p>\n<p>Case I :</p>\n<p>Statement 1 : In the 1<sup>st</sup> case the mechanical energy is completely converted into heat energy because of friction.</p>\n<p>Case II :</p>\n<p>M.E. is converted into heat due to friction but another part of M.E. is retained in the form of P.E. of block. Therefore statement I is correct.</p>\n<p>Statement 2 : This is a wrong statement because the coefficient of friction between block and surface does not depend on angle of inclination.</p>"}]}